  description: Encased within formidable armour, Black Knights are warriors whose
    martial cultivation has elevated them beyond ordinary mortal limitations. Their
    identities are often concealed, their allegiances uncertain. Some accounts describe
    them as disgraced champions, while others suggest they are guardians bound by
    ancient and unbreakable oaths.
